<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span><span id="A5.SS2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Store in Memory</span> Functions</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A5.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">core_memory_append</span></p>
<ul id="A5.I2.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Description:</span> Appends information to the contents of core memory (user/agent’s persona information).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Args:</span></p>
<ul id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">name (str):</span> Section of the memory to be edited (persona or human).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">content (str):</span> Content to write to the memory. All unicode (including emojis) are supported.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">core_memory_replace</span></p>
<ul id="A5.I2.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Description:</span> Replaces the contents of core memory. To delete memories, use an empty string for new_content.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Args:</span></p>
<ul id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">name (str):</span> Section of the memory to be edited (persona or human).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">old_content (str):</span> String to replace. Must be an exact match.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i2.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">new_content (str):</span> Content to write to the memory. All unicode (including emojis) are supported.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">contextual_memory_insert</span></p>
<ul id="A5.I2.i3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Description:</span> Adds new information to contextual memory.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Args:</span></p>
<ul id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">content (str):</span> The content to be written into the memory. Should be a sentence or two.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">tags (str):</span> The tags for the context to be written into the memory. The tags should be a string separated by ”;”.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">conversation (str):</span> The conversation to be written into the memory.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">filepath (Optional[str]):</span> The url/path to the image/video/audio file. Only passed if ‘modality’ is not ”text”.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i3.I1.i2.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">modality (str):</span> The type of the content (text/video/audio/image) to insert into the memory.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.3 </span><span id="A5.SS3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Retrieve</span> Functions</h3>

<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A5.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">conversation_search</span></p>
<ul id="A5.I3.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Description:</span> Searches prior conversation history using case-insensitive string matching.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Args:</span></p>
<ul id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">query (str):</span> String to search for.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">page (int):</span> Allows you to page through results. Only use on a follow-up query. Defaults to 0 (first page).</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Returns:</span> <span id="A5.I3.i1.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">str:</span> Query result string.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">conversation_search_date</span></p>
<ul id="A5.I3.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A5.I3.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I3.i2.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
